8. Network and data

The Software sends no telemetry, collects no information about You or the
people who use Your product, and makes no network requests. It reads and
writes documents only through the code You give it to do so, and, if You use
its FileTools, the files in the folder You name and nothing outside it. Apart
from those documents, it reads only:

  (a) the files You, or the documents You give the Software, name;
  (b) its own files, including the fonts and WebAssembly modules in this
      package; and
  (c) the fonts installed on the machine that runs it, unless You tell it not
      to.


